      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "WORKAROUND - CAN BE DELETED AFTER FIRST RUN. \n\nComfyUI-Manager install trigger for ppm node pack.\n\nThe node sat quietly in the vast expanse of the workflow graph, its outline dim, barely noticed. It wasn’t like the others—glorious nodes with specific purposes, weaving complex algorithms, producing stunning outputs. No, this was a dummy node, placed here not to create or transform but simply to exist.\n\nIt had a single, quiet duty: to wake up the ComfyUI-Manager. It wasn’t glamorous or creative. It didn’t get the satisfaction of contributing to high-res fixes or ensuring smooth scheduling. Its only purpose was to make sure the manager noticed its kind. Without it, the ppm node pack would remain ignored, its schedulers languishing in silence.\n\nYet no one acknowledged the node’s role. Users cursed it when they saw it, confused by its presence. “What’s this doing here?” they would ask, before promptly deleting it. The node never protested. It couldn’t. It just sat there, sad and silent, hoping one day someone might understand it was not purposeless, just misunderstood.\n\nBut day after day, it was forgotten, a placeholder in a world that celebrated results. Its edges flickered, a dim light fading. And still, it waited."
      ]
    },
